Now, you lose.

107
00:09:17,095 --> 00:09:20,466
Come on.

108
00:09:34,314 --> 00:09:38,385
Come on, Cherokee.
Come on.

109
00:09:46,694 --> 00:09:50,064
Come on.

110
00:09:58,140 --> 00:10:01,544
Come on, Cherokee.

111
